2025-07-06 01:32:15,653 - INFO - executor:run_user_code:292 - 🐍 Phase 2: Python code execution for step T001 - session 51745677 - code results:: {'status': 'success', 'result': {'s_class_features_T001': [{'type': 'text', 'text': '[{\'url\': \'https://mercedes-benz-media.co.uk/assets/applications/original/47010-the-s-class-from-mercedes-amg-perfect-synthesis-of-comfort-and-dynamism-with-e-performance-press-kit-december-2022.pdf\', \'content\': \'[error] Timeout while extracting content\', \'rank\': 1}, {\'url\': \'https://www.caranddriver.com/mercedes-benz/s-class\', \'content\': "Skip to Content Global Nav Search SUBSCRIBE SIGN IN RESEARCH CARS EXPERT REVIEWS SHOPPING TOOLS WHATS MY CAR WORTH? EXPERT-TESTED GEAR NEWS + STORIES MAINTENANCE HomeMercedes-BenzS-Class 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 2019 2018 2017 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class 9.5 / 10 C/D RATING JESSICA LYNN WALKER|CAR AND DRIVER View Photos MSRP $118,900$129,750 Car and Driver Accolades What\'s this? Editors\' Choice AT A GLANCE OVERVIEW RANK WHAT\'S NEW PRICING ENGINE & PERFORMANCE 0-60 TIME RANGE FUEL ECONOMY INTERIOR INFOTAINMENT & TECH SAFETY WARRANTY & MAINTENANCE HIGHS Sophisticated and elegant inside and out, remarkably quick for its size, refined ride. LOWS Overwhelming amount touchscreen controls, adaptive cruise and hands-free mode can get agitated, 3-D gauge cluster is a swing and miss. VERDICT Not only the flagship of the brand, the S-class also serves as the de facto flagship of luxury sedans in general. Specs SEE ALL SPECS EPA MPG 51 Combined Seating 5 Seats Cargo Capacity 813 Cubic Feet Powertrain Gas Drivetrain All-Wheel Drive Limited Warranty 4 Years/50,000 Miles By Andrew Wendler Overview Long the choice for buyers seeking solid, unaffable deportment and a distinguished presence, the Mercedes-Benz S-class has become synonymous with power and wealth. Its six-figure starting price certainly plays a part, but it wouldn\'t have stayed on top for so long without the class-leading ride and comfort, upscale furnishings, and smooth and muscular powertrains that define it. The latter comes in the form of either a 442-hp turbocharged straight-six, a 496-hp twin-turbo V-8, or a plug-in hybrid that pairs the turbo six with an electric motor. The ride and handling benefit from a standard air-spring suspension, and heated and ventilated massaging front seats coddle the occupants. Well-equipped as standard, there\'s also a long list of optional hides, woods, and colors to personalize the S-class to your taste. If there is an area of contention, it\'s the sheer number of screens and their almost overwhelming amount of controls and features. Still, while many rivals including the Audi A8, BMW 7-series, and Genesis G90 have made inroads onto the big Benz\'s turf, for now at least, it remains the king of full-size luxury sedans. As one of our favorites in its segment, the Mercedes-Benz S-class has also earned a spot on our Editors Choice list for 2025. Where This Vehicle Ranks #1 in Best Full-Size Luxury Cars 1 Mercedes-Benz S-class STARTING AT: $118,900 2 Genesis G90 STARTING AT: $91,195 3 BMW 7-series STARTING AT: $98,475 4 Mercedes-AMG S-Class STARTING AT: $187,350 5 Audi A8 STARTING AT: $93,295 6 Audi S8 STARTING AT: $126,595 New! Compare the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-class with the top vehicles in this segment with our new compare tool. COMPARE THE TOP CARS What\'s New for 2025? Mild updates arrive for 2025, including a center airbag and a standard digital key. New Verde Silver and Sonoran Brown exterior paint hues that fill in for the departing Mojave Silver and Onyx Black. The four-zone climate control, previously available only as part of a package, is now a standalone option; similarly, AMG Line trim is now a standalone package that can be added to the Luxury and Executive trims. Those looking for an even mightier, performance-focused model can check out the AMG S-class . And for those with money to burn, there\'s the Mercedes-Maybach S-class (both reviewed separately). Pricing and Which One to Buy The price of the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-class starts at $118,900 and goes up to $129,750 depending on the trim and options. S500 $118,900 S580e $129,350 S580 $129,750 0 $50k $100k $150k $200k Once you pass the $100K point, economizing seems pointless. We suggest going for the S580 as it nets the big turbo V-8, not to mention Nappa leather upholsterysure the S500 has leather, but not Nappa leatherand a heated steering wheel as standard kit. Live a little. Want to compare the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-class to other vehicles you\'re interest", \'images\': [], \'rank\': 2}, {\'url\': \'https://www.mercedes-amg.com/en/s-class-sedan\', \'content\': \'[error] Timeout while extracting content\', \'rank\': 3}, {\'url\': \'https://www.carsandhorsepower.com/reviews/exploring-the-features-of-the-2024-s-class\', \'content\': "Exploring the Features of the 2024 S-Class Cars&Horsepower Home News Featured Reviews Buying Guides ABOUT Us Contact Us Privacy Policy / Terms of Use / Disclaimer Cars&Horsepower Home News Featured Reviews Buying Guides ABOUT Us Contact Us Privacy Policy / Terms of Use / Disclaimer Home Reviews Exploring the Features of the 2024 S-Class Exploring the Features of the 2024 S-Class 9 min read 30 Dec 30 Dec The 2024 S-Class is the latest flagship luxury sedan from Mercedes-Benz. It\'s a symbol of the brand\'s commitment to innovation, luxury, and performance. The S-Class has always been a benchmark in the automotive industry. The 2024 model continues this tradition, pushing boundaries in design, technology, and comfort. This article explores the features that make the 2024 S-Class stand out. We delve into its design evolution, technological advancements, and what sets it apart in the luxury car market. We\'ll look at the exterior and interior design, the cutting-edge infotainment system, and the advanced safety features. We\'ll also discuss the powertrain options and the role of electrification in the lineup. Whether you\'re a poten